  "subject": "多元数理科学研究科_全专攻",
  "text": "利用留数计算求以下积分的值：\n$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{e^{ix}}{x^2+1} \\, dx$$",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "留数定理",
    "单极点留数",
    "Jordan引理",
    "含参积分",
    "复平面上的积分"
  ],
  "question_type": "利用留数定理计算实积分",
  "method": [
    "Jordan contour（上半平面闭合）",
    "单极点留数计算",
    "留数定理"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "识别被积函数的极点位置",
    "选择合适的积分路径（上半平面)",
    "利用Jordan引理验证弧段贡献趋于零",
    "计算上半平面的留数",
    "应用留数定理得出结果"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "residue_theorem_real_integral",
    "template": "$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} \\frac{e^{i\\alpha x}P(x)}{Q(x)} dx = 2\\pi i \\sum \\text{Res}$（$Q$ 在上半平面的零点）",
    "variable_count": 1
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "求积分值",
      "steps": [
        "**识别极点**：分母 $z^2 + 1 = 0$ 的解为 $z = \\pm i$。",
        "只有 $z = i$ 在上半平面（$\\text{Im}(z) > 0$）。",
        "**选择积分路径**：取 Jordan contour 由实轴上 $[-R, R]$ 段和上半圆弧 $|z| = R$、$\\text{Im}(z) \\geq 0$ 组成。",
        "**验证弧段趋于零**：在上半圆弧上，设 $z = Re^{i\\theta}$，$0 \\leq \\theta \\leq \\pi$。",
        "则 $e^{iz} = e^{iRe^{i\\theta}} = e^{iR(\\cos\\theta + i\\sin\\theta)} = e^{-R\\sin\\theta} \\cdot e^{iR\\cos\\theta}$。",
        "当 $0 < \\theta < \\pi$ 时，$\\sin\\theta > 0$，故 $|e^{iz}| = e^{-R\\sin\\theta} \\to 0$（$R \\to \\infty$）。",
        "在弧段上，$|f(z)| \\sim \\frac{|e^{iz}|}{R^2}$ 趋于零（由 Jordan 引理）。",
        "**计算留数**：在 $z = i$ 处为单极点。",
        "$$\\text{Res}(f, i) = \\lim_{z \\to i} (z - i) \\cdot \\frac{e^{iz}}{(z-i)(z+i)} = \\lim_{z \\to i} \\frac{e^{iz}}{z+i} = \\frac{e^{i \\cdot i}}{i+i} = \\frac{e^{-1}}{2i}$$",
        "**应用留数定理**：",
        "$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{e^{ix}}{x^2+1} dx = 2\\pi i \\cdot \\text{Res}(f, i) = 2\\pi i \\cdot \\frac{e^{-1}}{2i} = \\pi e^{-1}$$",
        "$$\\boxed{\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{e^{ix}}{x^2+1} dx = \\frac{\\pi}{e}}$$"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
    {
      "text": "利用留数计算：$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{\\cos x}{x^2+4} \\, dx$$",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "留数定理",
        "欧拉公式",
        "实部取法"
      ],
      "question_type": "留数计算实积分",
      "method": [
        "用 $e^{ix}$ 替代 $\\cos x$",
        "取实部"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "改写为复函数积分",
        "应用留数定理",
        "取实部"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "residue_cosine_integral",
        "template": "$\\cos x = \\text{Re}(e^{ix})$ 的积分转化",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "计算积分",
          "steps": [
            "利用欧拉公式 $\\cos x = \\text{Re}(e^{ix})$。",
            "$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{\\cos x}{x^2+4} dx = \\text{Re}\\left(\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{e^{ix}}{x^2+4} dx\\right)$$",
            "分母 $x^2 + 4 = 0$ 的根为 $z = \\pm 2i$，仅 $z = 2i$ 在上半平面。",
            "单极点 $z = 2i$ 的留数：",
            "$$\\text{Res}(f, 2i) = \\lim_{z \\to 2i} (z-2i) \\cdot \\frac{e^{iz}}{(z-2i)(z+2i)} = \\frac{e^{i \\cdot 2i}}{2i+2i} = \\frac{e^{-2}}{4i}$$",
            "由留数定理：",
            "$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{e^{ix}}{x^2+4} dx = 2\\pi i \\cdot \\frac{e^{-2}}{4i} = \\frac{\\pi e^{-2}}{2}$$",
            "取实部：",
            "$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{\\cos x}{x^2+4} dx = \\text{Re}\\left(\\frac{\\pi e^{-2}}{2}\\right) = \\boxed{\\frac{\\pi}{2e^2}}$$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-b2a59dbd58-q04-practice-01",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    },
    {
      "text": "利用留数定理计算：$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{x \\sin x}{x^2+9} \\, dx$$",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "留数定理",
        "奇函数性质",
        "留数计算"
      ],
      "question_type": "留数积分",
      "method": [
        "奇偶性分析",
        "留数定理"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "判断被积函数奇偶性",
        "应用结论或用留数"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "residue_sine_integral",
        "template": "$\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} \\frac{x \\sin x}{x^2+a^2} dx = \\frac{\\pi}{e^a}$ 型积分",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 12,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "计算积分",
          "steps": [
            "**方法1（奇偶性）**：被积函数 $f(x) = \\frac{x\\sin x}{x^2+9}$ 是偶函数乘以奇函数 = 奇函数。",
            "因此 $\\boxed{\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{x\\sin x}{x^2+9} dx = 0}$。",
            "**方法2（留数）**：利用 $\\sin x = \\frac{e^{ix} - e^{-ix}}{2i}$。",
            "$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{x\\sin x}{x^2+9} dx = \\text{Im}\\left(\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{x e^{ix}}{x^2+9} dx\\right)$$",
            "这个积分实际上是奇函数的积分（关于实轴的某种对称性），结果为 0。"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-b2a59dbd58-q04-practice-02",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    },
    {
      "text": "用留数定理求：$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{1}{(x^2+1)(x^2+4)} \\, dx$$",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "留数定理",
        "多个单极点",
        "部分分式分解"
      ],
      "question_type": "多个极点的留数积分",
      "method": [
        "识别所有上半平面极点",
        "计算各极点留数",
        "求和"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "找极点",
        "各自求留数",
        "求和应用定理"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "multiple_poles_residue",
        "template": "多个单极点时，$\\int = 2\\pi i \\sum \\text{Res}$",
        "variable_count": 2
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 15,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "计算积分",
          "steps": [
            "极点：$z^2+1=0 \\Rightarrow z = \\pm i$；$z^2+4=0 \\Rightarrow z = \\pm 2i$。",
            "上半平面极点：$z = i$ 和 $z = 2i$。",
            "**在 $z = i$ 的留数**：",
            "$$\\text{Res}(f, i) = \\lim_{z \\to i} (z-i) \\cdot \\frac{1}{(z-i)(z+i)(z^2+4)} = \\frac{1}{(i+i)(i^2+4)} = \\frac{1}{2i \\cdot 3} = \\frac{1}{6i}$$",
            "**在 $z = 2i$ 的留数**：",
            "$$\\text{Res}(f, 2i) = \\lim_{z \\to 2i} (z-2i) \\cdot \\frac{1}{(z^2+1)(z-2i)(z+2i)} = \\frac{1}{(4i^2+1)(2i+2i)} = \\frac{1}{(-4+1) \\cdot 4i} = \\frac{1}{-12i} = -\\frac{1}{12i}$$",
            "**应用留数定理**：",
            "$$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} \\frac{1}{(x^2+1)(x^2+4)} dx = 2\\pi i \\left(\\frac{1}{6i} - \\frac{1}{12i}\\right) = 2\\pi i \\cdot \\frac{2-1}{12i} = 2\\pi i \\cdot \\frac{1}{12i} = \\boxed{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}$$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "nagoya-2001-b2a59dbd58-q04-practice-03",
      "school": "名古屋大学",
      "year": "2001"
    }
  ],
